---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: Individuate · Thoughtful apps for particular passions
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import work, tombstone -%}
<section class="wall-text">
  <h1>Thoughtful apps for <b>particular</b> passions.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Food, music, writing, your health, and the way you talk to yourself, each with an app of its own. Mostly for the Mac. No accounts, and what you make stays yours.</p>
</section>

<section class="hang" aria-label="The collection">
  {% for a in apps %}
  <a class="piece" href="/{{ a.slug }}/" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
    <span class="light"></span>
    {{ work(a, true) }}
    {{ tombstone(a) }}
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="info-wall" aria-label="Visitor information">
  <div>
    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>One page with each app's common questions, and one address for everything else.</p>
    <p><a href="/support/">Support</a> · <a href="mailto:{{ site.support }}">{{ site.support }}</a></p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>No accounts, no advertising, no selling data. The apps send anonymous usage counts showing which features get used, and one policy says exactly what leaves your device, app by app.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/">Privacy at Individuate</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
